{
  "format": "pinmame-harness-scenario",
  "version": 1,
  "notes": "Boot an NBA Fastbreak ROM from an empty NVRAM with the coin door open (public 22 released); the scenario names no game. Leave the fresh-NVRAM loop with Escape, wait out the power-up mechanism test and open the service menu. Start T.4 SOLENOID TEST in repeat mode and step it with Up 28 times so it wraps. In repeat mode the ROM pulses the selected driver and prints its name and wire colours, so each step pairs a printed name with the public address PinMAME published. The checkpoint fails the run unless T.4 starts on solenoid 1.",
